OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be a cloudy day with
OL,6,Foutbreaks of rain throughout. Rain
OL,7,Fwill mostly be light and patchy but
OL,8,Fsome heavier bursts are possible,
OL,9,Fespecially across Argyll where winds
OL,10,Fwill also be fresher.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA mostly cloudy night with
OL,13,Flight and patchy rain slowly clearing
OL,14,Fto the south. A little rain lingering
OL,15,Fover parts of Argyll and Ayrshire by
OL,16,Fthe end of the night.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
