OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FRain clearing to the south
OL,6,Fleaving a mostly dry day with bright
OL,7,Fand sunny spells developing from the
OL,8,Fnorth. Breezy around coasts at first
OL,9,Fbut easing later.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FIt will
OL,12,Fbe dry and cold on Friday and Saturday
OL,13,Fwith long sunny spells and overnight
OL,14,Ffrost. Turning cloudier on Sunday with
OL,15,Fwinds strengthening and rain possible
OL,16,Flater.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
